        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #333;\"><h3 style=\"color: #0052cc; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Daily PO Escalation Run Summary</h3><p>The automated procurement check has concluded for <strong>{{ $json.run_date }}</strong>.</p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 480px; margin: 16px 0;\"><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #333;\"><strong>POs in tracker:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; color: #333;\"><strong>{{ $json.total_evaluated }}</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #d9381e;\"><strong>Newly flagged, awaiting your approval:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; color: #d9381e;\"><strong>{{ $json.flagged_count }}</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #0d8a43;\"><strong>Auto-passed (on track):</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; color: #0d8a43;\"><strong>{{ $json.auto_passed_count }}</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #333;\"><strong>Already in approval flow / cooling down:</strong></td><td style=\"padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; color: #333;\"><strong>{{ $json.in_workflow_count }}</strong></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666;\">&bull; Flagged POs: {{ $json.flagged_po_list }}</p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #888; margin-top: 20px;\">No supplier email is sent until a reviewer approves it in the Escalation Console. Audit events are appended to the <code>Execution_Log</code> tab.</p></div>",
