        "text": "=Target supplier: {{ $('Identify Target Supplier').item.json.target_supplier }}\n\nStep 1: Analyze known supply chain disruptions, market dynamics, and operational profile for this supplier.\nStep 2: Synthesize your findings into a strictly formatted intelligence brief using exactly these headers:\n\n### Verified Facts\n[List 3-4 facts from your general knowledge. No live search is available, so label each one (unverified)]\n\n### Operational Inferences\n[Deduce how these facts might impact lead times or production]\n\n### Prescribed Countermeasures\n[Suggest 2 tactical supply chain actions to mitigate this specific risk]\n\nIf you find no negative news, state that the supplier appears operationally stable based on current web data.",
